      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syötä tämä koodi laitteella, jota %@ käyttää"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expires in 7 days. Generating a new code cancels this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vanhenee 7 päivässä. Uuden koodin luominen mitätöi tämän."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Family name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perheen nimi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Household": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have a code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minulla on koodi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm a parent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Olen vanhempi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm a parent — sign in": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Olen vanhempi – kirjaudu sisään"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If other devices can't connect either, the Supabase project has probably paused after a week of inactivity. Open the Supabase dashboard and resume it — nothing is lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jos muutkaan laitteet eivät saa yhteyttä, Supabase-projekti on todennäköisesti keskeytetty viikon käyttämättömyyden jälkeen. Avaa Supabasen hallintapaneeli ja jatka projektia – mitään ei katoa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last updated %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Päivitetty viimeksi %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poistu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this family": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poistu perheestä"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this family?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poistutaanko perheestä?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaving gives up your place. Getting back in needs a new code from the other parent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poistuminen luovuttaa paikkasi. Takaisin pääsy vaatii uuden koodin toiselta vanhemmalta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hallinta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uusi koodi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New family": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uusi perhe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No children yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei vielä lapsia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No children yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei vielä lapsia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No chores yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei vielä tehtäviä."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei käytössä"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a parent who has signed in with Apple can start a family. Sign in with Apple, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vain Applella kirjautunut vanhempi voi aloittaa perheen. Kirjaudu Applella ja yritä uudelleen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed if they get a new device or reinstall the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tarvitaan vain, jos hän saa uuden laitteen tai asentaa sovelluksen uudelleen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vanhempi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parents": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vanhemmat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parents share everything: each can edit chores and the schedule, and tick anything off. Tap another parent to show a setup code for their device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vanhemmilla on samat oikeudet: kumpi tahansa voi muokata tehtäviä ja aikataulua ja merkitä mitä tahansa tehdyksi. Napauta toista vanhempaa näyttääksesi käyttöönottokoodin hänen laitteelleen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihmiset"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please fill in both names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Täytä molemmat nimet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poista"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename chore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vaihda tehtävän nimi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
